# Saved monitor profiles are machine-specific (autorandr --save <name>); only hooks are tracked.
# `default` is a symlink to autorandr's built-in `common` profile (mirror all screens at the
# largest shared resolution). It is the fallback whenever no saved profile matches, so any
# HDMI screen/TV works on every machine without saving a profile first.
*
!.gitignore
!postswitch
!default
